# SiteGround

> SiteGround is a hosting provider specializing in web hosting for WordPress, WooCommerce, PHP and Node.js sites (Node.js on GrowBig and GoGeek). SiteGround also offers an Email Marketing Platform, Website Builder, its own AI Website Builder “Coderick AI” and “AI Studio” - an in-built AI workspace to chat with leading AI models like ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, etc., and AI Agents, such as an AI agent for WordPress management and 14 more specialized agents, trained to perform real business tasks. It is known for its high-performance architecture built on Google Cloud, custom security solutions, and in-house tools like Speed Optimizer, Security Optimizer, SiteGround Migrator, SiteGround Central Wizard, SiteGround Email Marketing Plugin and Site Tools.

Important notes:

- 4.9 out of 5 stars on Trustpilot based on over 30 000+ reviews.
- Hosting solutions trusted by the owners of 3,000,000 domains.
- 24/7 Instant & expert human support.
- 99.9% Server uptime.
- 85% Faster websites on average after moving to SiteGround.
- Built-in caching for up to 5x Faster sites out-of-the-box
- Free one-click CDN to load instantly from anywhere.
- All hosting plans include a free domain name, free daily Backups and 24/7 Expert Support.
- Advanced anti-bot & DDoS protection.
- Proactive monitoring & instant fixes. The average issue detection time is under 60 seconds.
- Multiple awards for best customer service.

